# ******************************************************************
# Program     : .editorconfig
# Application : CardDemo
# Type        : Editor formatting contract (repository hygiene)
# Function    : Deterministic whitespace, charset and line-ending
#               conventions for the Java 25 / Spring Boot tree added
#               alongside the frozen legacy corpus, stopping at the
#               boundary of app/, samples/ and diagrams/.
# Source      : app/cbl/CBACT04C.cbl:1-21 (fixed-column COBOL whose
#               banner is space-padded to column 72 and body text to
#               column 80 - spacing that is load bearing) +
#               app/data/EBCDIC/** (records with no line terminator at
#               all) @ 7756d89
# ******************************************************************
